# laguna-s-2.1 edit profile: DFlash + ngram-mod on the unified build. Edits 79.1 tok/s (+103%), chat 36.6 / code 44.4 (neutral).
# Gated (needle 15/15 @81K, agentic 5/5), but in agentic turns the n-gram drafts accepted only 25-29% and the suite took 2,625 s
# (production 1,632 s): use it for copy-heavy edits, laguna-s-2.1-halo.env for agent serving.
# Set as env vars: GGML_VK_FA_WAVE32=1 GGML_VK_FA_KV_SLICE=4096 GGML_VK_FA_KV_SLICE_MAX_MB=4096 LLAMA_SPARSE_ATTN=64,64,16384
#   DFLASH_SWA=1024 LLAMA_SPEC_ADAPTIVE=1.2 GGML_VK_FA_SPARSE_MIN_RATIO_Q=2
MODEL_SOURCE="-m /models/Laguna-S-2.1-Q4-lean/Laguna-S-2.1-Q4-lean-00001-of-00003.gguf"
MODEL_ALIAS=poolside/Laguna-S-2.1
# MODEL_IMAGE: a llama-server build of llama.cpp 529ac893e + patches/llama.cpp-halo (Vulkan)
MODEL_ARGS="--n-gpu-layers 999 --flash-attn on -fit off --load-mode none --parallel 1 --ctx-size 262144 -ctk q8_0 -ctv q8_0 --ubatch-size 4096 --batch-size 4096 --cache-ram 0 --jinja --temp 1.0 --top-p 1.0 --top-k 20 --min-p 0.0 -md /models/Laguna-S-2.1-UD-Q5_K_XL/laguna-s-2.1-dflash-Q8_0.gguf -ngld 999 --spec-type draft-dflash,ngram-mod --spec-draft-n-max 4"
